    },
    {
      "title": "Game Modes",
      "anchor": "Game_Modes",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Conquest",
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Base Teleporters now bring you to the next teleport location if the current teleport target dies"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Fire Giant now spawns 1min after the Naga dies, down from 5min (the latest it can now spawn is 19:00, previously 23:00)"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Totem now grants all teammates of its killer with a global +4 Mana Regeneration and +5% Movement Speed buff for 8s"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Joust Quickplay",
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Increased Minion spawn frequency from every 30s to every 22s"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "subsections": []
    },
    {
      "title": "Item Balance",
      "anchor": "Item_Balance",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "“We are seeing Junglers have too strong of an impact in the very early stages of the game; both in the potency of their ganks and how much farm they can accumulate. We will likely revisit overall map farm and pacing as we continue to see how the removal of the side camps have affected the map, but adjusting the Jungle starters lets us more quickly target this aspect of Conquest.  Additionally, we saw a few junglers overperforming. We want to see how this adjusts them first; with the single exception of Da Ji who will receive additional nerfs.”"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
