        {
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Medusa (Buff)",
              "bold": true,
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "“Medusa's Intelligence vs. Strength scaling largely came at the cost of her old playstyle; a style that more intrinsically combined strong attack damage with strong ability pressure. After iterating on Strength and Intelligence as a core mechanic in Smite 2, we've found we prefer hybrid scaling that pushes new playstyles rather than simply splitting attack vs. ability damage. While we may revisit Medusa more comprehensively in the future, these Strength adjustments will bring her closer to her tried-and-true identity.”"
                },
                {
                  "text": "General",
                  "items": [
                    {
                      "text": "Fixed an issue where her tooltips did not show the proper information when in the non-expanded view."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": "Viper Shot (1)",
                  "items": [
                    {
                      "text": "Increased Damage Over Time: 10/15/20/25/30 -> 12/19/26/33/40"
